% Regression guard for microtones of 2 semitones or more, and for integer
% microtones without %%MIDI temperamentequal, in the normal temperament.
% The pitch bend covers +/- 2 semitones: a wider microtone was clipped
% there (^9/4F played G), and an integer microtone, as ^3F, divided by
% zero.  As in abc2svg, the whole semitones now go into the note and an
% integer counts semitones.  Relative to F, the notes are raised by 2.25,
% -2.25, 1.5 (in range, unchanged), 2, 3 and -3 semitones.
X:1
T:Microtones of 2 semitones or more
C:abc2midi test
M:1/4
L:1/4
K:C
^9/4F|_9/4F|^3/2F|^2F|^3F|_3F|
